# Bienenschwarm: a dancing swarm of 6 honey bees. Each bee: striped body
# Y/o with l stripes, wings w/h, its own k outline. No r.
# buzz = loose cluster, mixed headings, wings flapping out of step.
# waggle = tight cluster, bodies aligned, wings in step (the engine also
# shakes the sprite +-2 px across the run). Built with a scratch script
# (bee parts + automatic k outline), frozen to text here.
sprite = bienenschwarm
size   = 24x24
origin = 12,19
hitbox = 5,5,14,14
anim   = buzz   frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = waggle frames=2 ticks=4 loop
